<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n41801" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπομβρ-ία</span></b> , ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>heavy rain, abundance of rain,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Aph.</u>
				3.15
			</span></i> (pl.), <i><span class="en">
				D.
				55.11
			</span></i>, etc.: generally, <i>abundance of wet,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πνευμάτων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					300
				</span></i>
			 : opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αὐχμός,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hp.
			</span></i><i>Aër.</i><i><span class="en">
				23
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Nu.</u>
				1120
			</span></i> : pl., <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Mete.</u>
				360b6
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>HP</u>
				3.1.5
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Str.
				11.3.4
			</span></i>, etc. : metaph., <i>shower,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χερμάδων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Lyc.
					333
				</span></i>
			 ; <i>deluge,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δέλτων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Lib.
					<u>Ep.</u>
					333.5
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>the Deluge,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				J.
				<u>AJ</u>
				1.2.3
			</span></i>, al. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>humidity,</i> of the body, <i><span class="en">
				Aret.
				<u>SA</u>
				2.4
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>SD</u>
				2.1
			</span></i>.</div>
